    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "95eb0bb6_47009d69",
        "filename": "src/core/SkPaintParamsKey.h",
        "patchSetId": 21
      },
      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-11T16:23:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are right; in graphite, these are recorded into the DrawList with a null PaintParams* and originate from clip operations. An equivalent source in graphite would be stencil-only steps for path renderers (either as part of eventually filling the path, or to set the clip stencil bit); in these cases there is also no SkPaint associated with the stencil-only draw portion.\n\nDo we need a way to describe this concept as part of the code snippet IDs? Or should it be represented in the SkPaintParamsKey itself, with a reserved \"no-shading\" key?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 57,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "341762d2a23c7c6dec5e82af0565f838e1c7f171",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "13a2ed36_ccbc1f92",
        "filename": "src/core/SkPaintParamsKey.h",
        "patchSetId": 21
      },
      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 5631
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-11T18:11:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My gut feeling (and I hate to say this) is that we\u0027re missing a level of abstraction to differentiate between \"the thing that describes the components of the paint\", and \"how this paint happens to be implemented on the GPU backend\". Maybe some of the other changes proposed would help (and make this type more clearly align with the first goal), but as it stands:\n  - DepthStencilOnly is a GPU-only concept. That\u0027s an implementation detail of how a particular paint (or lack thereof?) gets rendered\n  - Yes, the set of actual specializations is going to be different between CPU and GPU.\n  \n... or maybe sharing keys is a pipe-dream? Even if we don\u0027t share the same *actual* keys, though, I\u0027d like to be able to share the types involved, and describe things for the CPU backend, where the set of implementation strategies for a particular SkShader won\u0027t be the same as it is for GPU.",
      "parentUuid": "95eb0bb6_47009d69",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 57,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "341762d2a23c7c6dec5e82af0565f838e1c7f171",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8f3c1481_92cd3956",
        "filename": "src/core/SkPaintParamsKey.h",
        "patchSetId": 21
      },
      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 5230
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-11T18:21:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed offline, we hope to go with a \"no-shading\" key and just omit code generation. To be done in a follow up cl.",
      "parentUuid": "95eb0bb6_47009d69",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 57,
        "endLine": 18,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "341762d2a23c7c6dec5e82af0565f838e1c7f171",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52c38d07_22967a8f",
        "filename": "src/core/SkPaintParamsKey.h",
        "patchSetId": 21
      },
      "lineNbr": 22,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-01-11T16:23:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I prefer kSolidColor here, even if the RenderStep or GeometryProcessor (in ganesh) consumes the functionality. Behaviorally there\u0027s no difference between a paint with the color and a null shader, and a paint with a solid-color SkShader set on it.\n\nIt also lets us use the kNoneShader for kDepthStencilOnlyDraws, which makes it a little more generalizable to ganesh when its path renderers do stencil-only draws.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "341762d2a23c7c6dec5e82af0565f838e1c7f171",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
