      "writtenOn": "2022-01-11T18:11:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the other option is that \"custom\" is a single snippet ID, followed by N bytes as a key for the particular custom SkSL? (note that this, and many other shader use-cases, is going to require putting values bigger than 1 byte into the key, which is easy but not yet present).",
